# Normalise line endings to LF in the repository and in working copies on
# every platform. Without this, Git for Windows' default core.autocrlf=true
# rewrites every file to CRLF locally, and the Track B dev team — likely on
# macOS/Linux — would see whole-file diffs on first checkout.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Brand assets and other binaries must never be line-ending converted.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
